            <h2>UACTF High School Competition</h2>
            <p>Every Spring, Crimson Defense hosts UACTF, a high school Capture-the-Flag competition and one of our biggest outreach efforts. Crimson Defense members can earn volunteer hours making cyber security challenges, participating in set-up, and helping us run UACTF. UACTF 2026 will be held on Saturday, Feb 28, 2026.</p>
            <p>Visit our <a href="/uactf">UACTF page</a> for the full competition details, training guides, and press coverage.</p>
