            <h2>Alabama Science Olympiad Codebusters</h2>
            <p>Crimson Defense members who specialize in encryption and cryptography helped run the Codebusters event at the 2024 and 2025 Science Olympiad University of Alabama regional. Our club members with Science Olympiad experience created the University of Alabama Regional Codebusters B and C test, as well as administered it the day of the competition.</p>
            <p><a href="https://scilympiad.com/al" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Click here for more information about Alabama Science Olympiad</a>!</p>
            <p>If you're interested in Cipher Cryptography, or competed in Science Olympiad in high school, talk to an Officer about volunteering with us!</p>
